flowchart LR
    FL["The first leader, once the<br/>request's block is final"] --> I
    BT["A backup leader's<br/>scheduled turn starts"] -->|"if no answer has landed,<br/>even while earlier leaders still try"| I
    I["Leader inspects"] --> A["Leader starts a session<br/>for its own outcome"]
    A --> Q{"Every follower<br/>signs?"}
    Q -->|"yes"| S["Signed answer"]
    Q -->|"no: a follower abstains, refuses,<br/>stays silent or sends a bad share"| R{"Fewer than three attempts,<br/>no answer landed, and<br/>the outcome unchanged?"}
    R -->|"yes: another asset,<br/>same outcome"| A
    R -->|"no"| X["This leader stops"]
    X -.->|"if no other attempt signs"| T["The request times out<br/>at 200 blocks"]
